{
  // Lights and utility parts (chunk 23): twelve lights, the glowstick, radio, beacon, horn, dispenser, saw blade,
  // drill, water cannon and the mounted potato blaster. Their behaviour is in Lua (D2); a light's look is its
  // light section. Parts map batch 5 gave the lights the wiki's stats and recipes, six new lights (shack, fluorescent,
  // packing, frame beam, neon, protector) and real models with on and off clips (tools/<part>/build_<part>.py).
  // Parts map batch 6 (working parts) gave the Water Cannon and Mounted Potato Blaster the wiki's stats, recipes and
  // linked containers, and added the Plasma Drill, the Small and Large Explosive Canisters, the Alarm Clock, the Cash
  // Register and the Scuttler Head (a placeable note player, still dropped by Scuttlers), each with a real model.
  // Consumables batch C1 gave the Glowstick the wiki's consumable stats and recipe (Ember stands in for Glow).
  // Re-run with tools/author-vanilla.sh.
